>

<p>Pinnacle Sales is a manufacturer's representative. We do not run a consumer storefront and we do not publish a dealer locator. If you already operate a kitchen &amp; bath showroom — or you are opening one — the path in is the same: apply, talk market, confirm what is open, then merchandize.</p>

<h2>What you actually do</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Apply.</strong> Use the form on <a href="/become-a-dealer/">Become a Dealer</a>. Name, showroom, city, state, current lines. Two business days to a call.</li>
  <li><strong>Market review.</strong> We look at your floor, trade vs. retail mix, and which of the six public brands — <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh</a>, <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse</a>, <a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect</a>, <a href="/brands/vistora-closets/">Vistora</a>, <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm</a>, <a href="/brands/us-stone-group/">US Stone</a> — your clients already ask for.</li>
  <li><strong>Territory.</strong> WW Wood protection is managed across 10 Western states. Pronorm is nationwide with its own protected map. See <a href="/guides/protected-dealer-territories/">protected dealer territories</a>.</li>
  <li><strong>Display and training.</strong> In-person line training, 2020/Winner quoting support, merchandising — not a webinar kit left on a shared drive.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Who this is for</h2>
<p>Independent kitchen &amp; bath showrooms, design-build firms, custom builders, interior studios that sell product, and multi-location dealer groups. You do not have to carry every WW Wood line to open <a href="/guides/pronorm-american-depths/">Pronorm</a>. You do not have to be in the West to talk Pronorm.</p>

<h2>What you do not need</h2>
<p>There is no application fee. There is no consumer “shop our kitchen” path on this site. Nevara is a dealer-only WW Wood SKU. It is not on this site.</p>

<p>Ready to talk? <a href="/become-a-dealer/">Become a dealer</a>.</p>

